OL,3,AAberfan stops to remember 60 years
OL,4,Asince coal tip collapsed, killing 116
OL,5,Achildren and 28 adults
OL,6,
OL,7,FMair Morgan, the last surviving teacher
OL,8,Fat the school, still remembers having
OL,9,Fto identify the children who died
OL,11,FA memorial garden that stands on the
OL,12,Fsite of the school was unveiled in 2019
OL,13,Fas the decision was made not to rebuild
OL,14,Fit after the disaster
OL,16,FKing Charles, Queen Camilla and the
OL,17,FPrince of Wales will later join
OL,18,Fsurvivors, bereaved parents and other
OL,19,Fmembers of the community at the garden
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
